This is maindec-08-dilab-d-pb, with the following patch:
0021: 4000 != 0000
0022: 0166 != 0566
5275: 0411 != 0111
5277: 0204 != 0205
6260: 0411 != 0111
6262: 0204 != 0205
6553: 5504 != 5501
